513:  Assuming that SGD terminates after only one epoch with a fixed order, we will show that \textsc{Debuggable-Lin} is solvable in linear time for linear loss. For hinge-like loss functions, \textsc{Debuggable-Lin} can be solved in linear time only when the dimension $d=1$ and the interception $\beta\ge 0$. For the rest cases, \textsc{Debuggable-Lin} becomes NP-hard. 
