+exponential and target-indexed dynamic programming is pseudopolynomial. Lattice
+reduction is a polynomial heuristic, not a certificate-producing algorithm
+guaranteed on this distribution. Selftest runs a bounded LLL embedding and a
+bounded exact branch-and-bound recurrence. The theorem is worst-case, so their
+distribution-specific failures are empirical evidence, not an average-case
