+```
+
+The planted output is `<answer>[0, 1, 3, 4]</answer>` and
+`verify(inst, [0, 1, 3, 4]) == (True, "ok")`.  Dropping the last ID gives
+`(False, "too few IDs: exactly 4 ordinary samples are required")`.  A person
